Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.51,0:01:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you go anywhere\Nfor summer vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.97,0:01:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, nowhere. I worked all summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that sounds nice. You must\Nhave saved a ton of money, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.77,0:01:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My family went to Hawaii.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks a lot like Hateno Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.62,0:01:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.83,0:01:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The ocean was insanely clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.74,0:01:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I was impressed by how many fish\Nyou could see when you went under.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.54,0:02:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mizuho...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:02:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.45,0:03:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.41,0:03:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did our going adrift ever actually happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.11,0:05:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough. I've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.95,0:05:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the guys in the basketball club\Nasked me to sub in again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys sure take me for granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.37,0:06:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.17,0:06:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it had to have happened--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,being adrift for those two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.82,0:06:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's come unfastened. Are we okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:07:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Right according to plan. It looks\Nlike we just passed the speed of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We've arrived at the\Nentrance to other dimensions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We should start getting ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.71,0:08:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you understand what\Nkind of consequences this will have?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Our original selves are different people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.47,0:08:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I don't think\Nthis is the place for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are nuts. So was she...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It would have been enough\Nif you'd never known.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.81,0:08:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What we've been given is plenty, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither here nor our original world\Nwill change. You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to get there on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.40,0:08:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nozomi was following her own heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.37,0:09:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The responsibility was her own, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.72,0:09:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all gone now. Even Ms. Aki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kossetsu went off to join Hoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Rajdhani's become a forest,\Nand is living with the animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hateno Island has sunk. It turns out...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,...nothing is left here for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.00,0:09:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.58,0:10:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not leave here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not saying that we\N{\i1}can't {\i0}leave here, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.67,0:10:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be all right this time. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.80,0:10:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.03,0:11:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you going to\Ntake that back with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know if Nozomi will be\Nalive once we get there, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.62,0:12:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we're using her Compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.49,0:12:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,None of the outcomes\Nare going to be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the things that {\i1}can {\i0}happen\N{\i1}do {\i0}happen in the world, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.91,0:12:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're going to\Nre-roll the possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Nagara,\Nwhat made you decide to go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,...is the light that Nozomi saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.75,0:14:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they're building\Napartments here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Grandma's cats are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that Tora passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.22,0:14:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.27,0:14:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he was 13 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He lived plenty long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.82,0:14:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The service that took them in is sure\Npricey, though. 400,000 yen for just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.49,0:14:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All three cats cost 1.2 million. But for\Nthat price, I'm sure they're doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.16,0:14:35.58,Alt Styling,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Everything's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mizuho...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.85,0:15:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.23,0:15:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.07,0:16:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nagara.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"Rajdhani's parrot laughs."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.14,0:17:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Is work hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should get a job, too.\NRent an apartment, and take in the cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't have to do it,\Nyou're better off not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of other stuff\Nthat you {\i1}have {\i0}to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.99,0:17:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that nothing was going to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,In my mind, I thought I understood that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.25,0:17:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the future that you chose, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.09,0:17:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember when you told me\Nonce that we couldn't change the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so it would be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.93,0:17:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still think so now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.77,0:17:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. We really can't change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is still the world that I chose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.41,0:18:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing here, looking back now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,there were just some probabilistic\Ncomponents at work back there,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and after some time now,\NI can't even tell them apart anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, I'll forget this feeling, too,\Nand do the same thing over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if Nozomi is the\Nsame Nozomi that we knew, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But this {\i1}is {\i0}the future that she saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you talked to Nozomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.15,0:18:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I've only spotted her so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.15,0:18:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't remember going adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.11,0:18:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she's a different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.12,0:18:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.76,0:19:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as there's still a little of\Nwho you were on that island in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.27,0:19:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You were worried about them, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, they were chirping at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy at the station\Nsaid that he thought
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,that maybe their mother\Nhad gotten killed by a crow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The others were all dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.28,0:21:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but this little one is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.15,0:21:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you look after it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.27,0:21:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? No, I'm not allowed to have pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.66,0:21:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We went to the same\Nmiddle school, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. You transferred in during\Nthe second term of 3rd year, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.87,0:21:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nozomi...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.67,0:21:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, sure enough,\Ntheir mother never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.71,0:21:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only one still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.80,0:21:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? So what are you going to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.39,0:21:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I think I'll look\Nafter it until it can fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.99,0:22:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lives are only beginning. What lies\Nahead will take just a little bit longer.
